-- The agreements' root (MMS-521): every collective agreement that speaks to
-- an item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), gathered from
-- one root per family of agreements, as the corpus groups them (MMS-548):
-- l4/lib/ofek-hadash-root.l4 and l4/lib/oz-latmura-root.l4. The root
-- (l4/lib/root.l4) imports it beside the takanon's and the circulars' roots
-- and leaves precedence to l4/lib/precedence.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT terms
IMPORT `ofek-hadash-root`
IMPORT `oz-latmura-root`

§ `שורש ההסכמים — מה ההסכמים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- The families' roots register their own agreements; this root includes
-- them all, family by family.
`the agreements' instruments` MEANS
    concat (LIST `the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments`, `the Oz LaTmura agreements' instruments`)

§§ `מה ההסכמים אומרים, לפי פריט`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the agreements' claims on` i c IS
    concat (LIST `the Ofek Hadash agreements' claims on` i c, `the Oz LaTmura agreements' claims on` i c)
